From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ws73v100: adapt the WAL cfg80211 ops to Linux 7.3

Add 7.3 wrappers for the wireless_dev, link_id, radio_idx and
scalar ROC/mgmt-tx cookie ABI, update the roam and station
notification calls, and replace the removed VFS namespace and
proc PDE helpers.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/driver/wifi/wal/release/linux/wal_linux_cfg80211.c
+++ b/driver/wifi/wal/release/linux/wal_linux_cfg80211.c
@@ -2489,8 +2489,12 @@
 #ifdef CONTROLLER_CUSTOMIZATION
     chan_def = &(netdev->ieee80211_ptr->u.ap.preset_chandef);
 #else
+#if (LINUX_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(7, 3, 0))
+    chan_def = &(netdev->ieee80211_ptr->u.ap.preset_chandef);
+#else
     chan_def = &(netdev->ieee80211_ptr->preset_chandef);
 #endif
+#endif
 
     /* 5G SoftAP暂时写死中心频率5210, 频宽80M(width 3), 待hostapd升级后删除 */
     if (chan_def->chan->band == OAL_IEEE80211_BAND_5GHZ) {
@@ -5755,18 +5759,177 @@
 
